Build telekinetic power and dump it onto an adjacent creature or yourself.

This will launch them to wherever you target in a radius of {{ctl|10|6|9}}.

Upon landing, launched enemy takes {{ctmd|20|180}} Physical damage and is stunned for half the throw range in turns.

All other creatures within radius 2 of the landing point take (0.5 * {{ctmd|20|180}}) Physical damage and are knocked away from you.

This talent ignores {{ctl|100%|25|45%}} of the knockback resistance of the thrown target, which takes half damage if it resists being thrown.

When used on yourself, you will launch in a straight line, knocking enemies flying and doing {{ctmd|20|180}} Physical damage to each.

You can break through half the throw range in walls while doing this.

The damage improves with your Mindpower and the range increases with both Mindpower and Strength.
